{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22425","headline":"首夏 · 白居易","name":"首夏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孟夏百物滋，动植一时好。\n麋鹿乐深林，虫蛇喜丰草。\n翔禽爱密叶，游鳞悦新藻。\n天和遗漏处，而我独枯槁。\n一身在天末，骨肉皆远道。\n旧国无来人，寇戎尘浩浩。\n沈忧竟何益，祗自劳怀抱。\n不如放身心，冥然任天造。\n浔阳多美酒，可使杯不燥。\n湓鱼贱如泥，烹炙无昏早。\n朝饭山下寺，暮醉湖中岛。\n何必归故乡，兹焉可终老。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22425.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22425","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}